WEBVTT

00:00:19.417 --> 00:00:20.875
Gabriel.

00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:26.958
Gabriel.

00:00:26.958 --> 00:00:30.500
Unlike humans, insects don't have brains.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.958
Then where do they think?

00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:39.000
In an insect's case, all of the nerves
throughout its body act as the brain.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.792
That's why, even if they lose their head,
they can still live for a while.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.917
If it's still alive even
after it loses its head,

00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:55.625
then where is the mantis' soul?

00:01:03.708 --> 00:01:05.167
Gabe!

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:08.750
Gabe!

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:14.333
Alicia!

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:17.625
Gabe, let's play!

00:01:17.625 --> 00:01:18.917
Okay!

00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:30.500
I wonder where Alicia's soul is?

00:01:32.167 --> 00:01:36.958
Unlike insects, humans can't live
if they lose their head.

00:01:36.958 --> 00:01:40.625
So the human soul must be in the head.

00:01:40.625 --> 00:01:44.042
It must be somewhere in the brain.

00:01:44.042 --> 00:01:49.417
Deep beneath Alicia's skin, skull,
and brain matter...

00:01:49.417 --> 00:01:51.833
...her soul is hidden.

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:08.458
"Dark Territory Obsidia Palace"

00:02:18.167 --> 00:02:19.458
Yo!

00:02:19.458 --> 00:02:21.333
Is that you, bro?

00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:22.917
Are you Vassago?

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:26.125
Yeah. That's right.

00:02:26.125 --> 00:02:29.792
Looks like we were able to log in as planned.

00:02:37.625 --> 00:02:41.208
Those are artificial Fluctlights?

00:02:41.208 --> 00:02:46.125
You're telling me they're
all humans with souls?

00:04:16.042 --> 00:04:20.042
"Dark Territory"

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.958
"Chief of the Flatland Goblins Kubiri"
Hurry! We flatland goblins will be the first
to reach His Majesty, the Emperor!

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.792
We're not getting beat
by a bunch of flatland slug eaters!

00:04:42.792 --> 00:04:46.125
"Chief of the Mountain Goblins Hagashi"
No one's getting the honor of the
first kill but us mountain goblins!

00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:55.083
"Chief of the Giants Sigurosig"

00:04:59.583 --> 00:05:02.875
"Chief of the Ogres Furgr"

00:05:04.667 --> 00:05:05.500
"Tenth Champion of the Pugilists Guild Iskahn"

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.333
"Tenth Champion of the Pugilists Guild Iskahn"
Whatever you do,
don't fall behind the other tribes!

00:05:10.542 --> 00:05:12.375
Let's go!

00:05:16.917 --> 00:05:19.792
"Head of the Assassins Guild Fu Za"

00:05:46.875 --> 00:05:49.125
I am the head of the commerce guild.
My name is Rengil Gila Scobo.

00:05:49.125 --> 00:05:53.167
"Head of the Commerce Guild Rengil Gila Scobo"
I am the head of the commerce guild.
My name is Rengil Gila Scobo.

00:05:53.167 --> 00:05:56.625
"Chief of the Orcs Lilpilin"
I'm chief of the orcs, Lilpilin!

00:05:56.625 --> 00:06:01.458
I'm the chancellor of the dark
mages guild, Dee Eye Ell.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:08.292
"Chancellor of the Dark Mages Guild Dee Eye Ell"
My 3,000 mages, as well my heart and body,
all belong to you, Your Majesty.

00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:15.542
I am the commander of the dark
knights brigade, Vixur ul Shasta.

00:06:15.542 --> 00:06:19.917
Before I offer you my sword,
I have a question for you, Emperor.

00:06:19.917 --> 00:06:25.542
Now that you've returned to your throne,
what is it that you seek?

00:06:27.625 --> 00:06:33.292
Blood and terror. Flames and destruction.
Death and screams.

00:06:35.208 --> 00:06:40.125
The western lands are full of the power of
the gods who expelled me from the heavens.

00:06:40.125 --> 00:06:44.542
The great gate that protects it is about
to crumble, even as we speak.

00:06:44.542 --> 00:06:50.500
I have returned to make my authority
known far and wide across the land.

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:56.292
The moment the great gate falls, the Human
Empire will belong to the people of darkness!

00:06:56.292 --> 00:06:58.667
I desire only one thing.

00:06:58.667 --> 00:07:03.625
The Priestess of Light, who appeared
at the same time in that land, and nothing else!

00:07:03.625 --> 00:07:08.917
I hereby grant you permission
to kill and seize any other human!

00:07:09.917 --> 00:07:15.500
Soldiers of the dark empire!
The time you have long awaited is nigh!

00:07:19.792 --> 00:07:24.625
I'll kill them! I'll kill every
last one of those White Iums!

00:07:27.125 --> 00:07:32.583
Battle! Battle!

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:06.375
I'm surprised you had that kind of talent, Bro.

00:08:08.625 --> 00:08:10.917
You should've become an actor instead.

00:08:10.917 --> 00:08:13.208
I just did what was necessary.

00:08:13.208 --> 00:08:17.625
You really should learn how to deliver
that kind of speech yourself.

00:08:17.625 --> 00:08:20.667
Since you're a level higher than those guys.

00:08:20.667 --> 00:08:23.208
Forget giving orders or speeches,

00:08:23.208 --> 00:08:25.375
I'd rather lead the charge into battle.

00:08:25.375 --> 00:08:30.250
Since we've dived into this
mind-blowing VR world.

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:33.417
This wine and this bottle
seem like the real thing to me.

00:08:33.417 --> 00:08:37.250
But in exchange,
if you get cut, it'll hurt and bleed.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:40.000
Since a pain absorber won't work here.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.833
That's what makes it great.

00:08:56.833 --> 00:08:58.000
Is that you, Captain?

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.167
Yeah.

00:08:59.167 --> 00:09:05.833
We've just returned to the Main Control Room
after watching you and Vassago dive.

00:09:05.833 --> 00:09:09.875
I see. It's already the night of first day here.

00:09:09.875 --> 00:09:13.625
I already knew about it,
but time acceleration still feels odd.

00:09:13.625 --> 00:09:17.333
For now, everything's proceeding as planned.

00:09:17.333 --> 00:09:20.292
We'll be done preparing
the units in a day or two,

00:09:20.292 --> 00:09:24.333
and commence our assault on the
Human Empire two days from now.

00:09:24.333 --> 00:09:26.167
Wonderful!

00:09:26.167 --> 00:09:27.125
Don't forget, all right?

00:09:27.125 --> 00:09:27.667
"Main Control Room 2 hours and 54 minutes
after the attack on the Ocean Turtle"

00:09:27.667 --> 00:09:30.958
"Main Control Room 2 hours and 54 minutes
after the attack on the Ocean Turtle"
Once you've taken ALICE into custody,
transport her there,

00:09:30.958 --> 00:09:35.125
and execute the command from the menu
to eject her into the Main Control Room.

00:09:35.125 --> 00:09:38.417
Then ALICE's Lightcube will be ours.

00:09:38.417 --> 00:09:42.875
Oh, one more thing. I want you to drill this
into that idiot Vassago's head.

00:09:42.875 --> 00:09:43.958
Huh?

00:09:43.958 --> 00:09:46.917
Since you can't do anything
that requires administrator privileges,

00:09:46.917 --> 00:09:49.125
it won't be possible to
reset your account, either.

00:09:49.125 --> 00:09:55.167
In other words, if you and Vassago die over there,
you can never use those superuser accounts again.

00:09:55.167 --> 00:09:58.792
So the next time you log in,
it will be as grunts.

00:09:58.792 --> 00:10:00.750
Right, I understand.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.500
What's the JSDF doing?

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.333
Nothing at the moment.

00:10:04.333 --> 00:10:07.708
It doesn't seem like they
realized you dove in yet.

00:10:07.708 --> 00:10:10.542
Good. All right, I'm signing off.

00:10:10.542 --> 00:10:14.125
Let's hope the next communication
will be after we've captured ALICE.

00:10:14.125 --> 00:10:16.375
Roger. I'm counting on you.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:22.208
That bastard Critter.

00:10:22.208 --> 00:10:28.083
Listen, Bro, would it be okay if I
swing by downtown to... No, I guess not.

00:10:28.083 --> 00:10:30.083
Just hold back for a while.

00:10:30.083 --> 00:10:33.167
Once the operation's over,
I'll let you have a whole night.

00:10:33.167 --> 00:10:36.458
Roger that. So no murder
and women for now, huh?

00:10:36.458 --> 00:10:39.417
In that case, I'm just going to hit the sack.

00:10:47.625 --> 00:10:50.542
What are you doing?

00:10:50.542 --> 00:10:54.833
I shall be keeping you company tonight, sir.

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:04.000
On whose order?

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.500
No.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:08.250
This is my duty.

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:09.917
I see.

00:11:11.708 --> 00:11:13.458
Pardon me.

00:11:23.542 --> 00:11:25.833
Who ordered you to do this?

00:11:25.833 --> 00:11:29.333
This is also my own choice.

00:11:29.333 --> 00:11:32.750
Then who's your commanding officer?

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:34.292
I don't have one.

00:11:35.292 --> 00:11:37.542
Why did you try to kill me?

00:11:37.542 --> 00:11:41.583
Were you offered money?
Were you promised status?

00:11:41.583 --> 00:11:43.500
It's for the greater good!

00:11:44.708 --> 00:11:46.458
If war breaks out now,

00:11:46.458 --> 00:11:49.917
it will set history back 100... no, 200 years!

00:11:49.917 --> 00:11:54.500
We cannot revert to an era of
oppression for the powerless!

00:12:24.083 --> 00:12:28.250
This is... just like what happened that day!

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:38.750
Right now, I'm looking at Alicia's soul.

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:43.417
And I'm also seeing what
Alicia's soul is seeing.

00:13:51.042 --> 00:13:57.667
This soul... I want to see more of
the vision that this soul is showing me!

00:14:12.958 --> 00:14:15.417
I love you.

00:14:16.458 --> 00:14:17.792
My lord.

00:14:18.792 --> 00:14:24.375
Magnificent. What a magnificent experience!

00:14:24.375 --> 00:14:32.292
The Lightcube housing this woman's Fluctlight is
connected to my own Fluctlight through the STL.

00:14:32.292 --> 00:14:37.875
Did a fragment of the quantum data
reverse course through its circuits?

00:14:37.875 --> 00:14:42.250
No, who cares about that?

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:46.750
Ever since Alicia, I've experimented
with so many people,

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:50.875
but just now, I was finally able to
experience that phenomenon again.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:55.083
Even a woman like this yielded that much.

00:14:55.083 --> 00:14:59.167
Meaning that the perfected version,
ALICE, will surely...

00:14:59.167 --> 00:15:04.958
ALICE, your soul... will be so sweet!

00:15:06.333 --> 00:15:09.042
"November 2, 380 HE"

00:15:25.375 --> 00:15:28.792
Your Majesty, preparations
for battle are complete.

00:15:28.792 --> 00:15:32.708
Just give the order,
and we can launch the assault anytime.

00:15:39.583 --> 00:15:41.292
The life of the Eastern Gate,

00:15:41.292 --> 00:15:45.333
which has divided the Human Empire and the
land of darkness since the time of creation,

00:15:45.333 --> 00:15:47.542
is now about to expire.

00:15:47.542 --> 00:15:49.958
The five tribes of the forces of darkness

00:15:49.958 --> 00:15:53.750
are all excited about a major
incursion into the Human Empire.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:58.417
But the order of the Integrity Knights
protecting the Human Empire are all formidable.

00:15:58.417 --> 00:16:02.333
If we try to push through with superior
numbers, we'll be worn down eventually,

00:16:02.333 --> 00:16:07.750
but by the time that last unit falls, I can't
imagine how much damage we'll have suffered.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:11.875
And that will lead to a power imbalance
among the five tribes.

00:16:11.875 --> 00:16:14.000
The Council of Ten will be powerless,

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:17.167
and our equal treaty among the
five tribes will have no meaning.

00:16:17.167 --> 00:16:21.208
If that happens, it will be the
Age of Iron and Blood all over again.

00:16:21.208 --> 00:16:23.625
We must avoid that at all costs.

00:16:23.625 --> 00:16:27.542
We must make peace.

00:16:28.625 --> 00:16:31.208
Integrity Knight Commander Bercouli.

00:16:32.417 --> 00:16:36.917
That man, if no one else, will surely
agree to our request for peace.

00:16:36.917 --> 00:16:42.417
Therefore, I must kill
Emperor Vecta, who seeks war.

00:16:42.417 --> 00:16:47.667
By the way, there was an intruder
in my sleeping quarters last night.

00:16:47.667 --> 00:16:50.417
Who had a dagger hidden in their hair.

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:57.542
I don't intend to condemn the person
who sent that assassin.

00:16:57.542 --> 00:17:02.792
There's nothing wrong with using your power
to gain even greater power.

00:17:02.792 --> 00:17:07.167
Should you want to take my head,
feel free to attack me from behind any time.

00:17:07.167 --> 00:17:13.958
Of course, that's only if you understand that
you'll pay the appropriate price for such a gamble.

00:17:13.958 --> 00:17:17.042
For example, such as this...

00:17:39.583 --> 00:17:42.292
Li... pia...

00:17:44.208 --> 00:17:47.792
We must make peace.

00:17:47.792 --> 00:17:53.333
Although thinking this way is hardly admirable
for a resident of the land of darkness.

00:17:53.333 --> 00:17:55.792
You may be right.

00:17:55.792 --> 00:17:58.125
But I admire you for it.

00:18:06.708 --> 00:18:11.375
That's why I fell in love with you.

00:18:35.792 --> 00:18:38.542
You were just injected with a poison so potent,

00:18:38.542 --> 00:18:44.292
it can kill even a colossal land dragon
with a life of over 30,000 in an hour.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:51.417
With your stamina and total life,
I'd say it'll be another two or three minutes.

00:19:04.583 --> 00:19:06.292
Lipia.

00:19:06.292 --> 00:19:08.833
I won't let you stop me!

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.583
Nothing.

00:20:19.583 --> 00:20:21.125
There's nothing here.

00:20:21.125 --> 00:20:24.417
Does this man... not know life?

00:20:25.583 --> 00:20:31.167
A man who knows nothing of the radiance
of life, of the soul, or of love.

00:20:31.167 --> 00:20:34.083
That's why he seeks other's souls.

00:20:35.292 --> 00:20:40.000
This man cannot be killed
with a murderous sword.

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:47.250
Because this man's soul is alive,
and yet dead at the same time.

00:20:48.667 --> 00:20:51.458
I'm sorry, Lipia.

00:21:00.875 --> 00:21:06.625
The troops who lost their general are to be
immediately taken over by the next in command.

00:21:06.625 --> 00:21:10.875
We will begin our assault as planned,
one hour from now.

00:21:19.667 --> 00:21:22.583
All hail His Majesty, the Emperor!

00:23:03.292 --> 00:23:05.208
"November 2, 380 HE    The Eastern Gate"

00:23:05.500 --> 00:23:09.333
So that's... the Eastern Gate.

00:23:09.333 --> 00:23:11.458
Stop, Amayori.

00:23:15.417 --> 00:23:20.917
"Destroyed... at the last... stage?"

00:23:44.625 --> 00:23:47.250
We're out of time!

00:23:48.417 --> 00:23:52.192
Next time: "The Night Before Battle."
